EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Good morning!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}It's shaping up to be a great day
for observing snowflakes!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Buenos días!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Estoy observando los copos
de nieve.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡Son todos únicos!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bonjour !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Si tu rêvais de voir des flocons de
neige, tu vas être servi{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}} aujourd'hui.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bonjour!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sto ammirando i fiocchi di neve...
Non ce n'è uno uguale all'altro!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Guten Morgen!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sieht aus, als wäre es ein guter Tag
zum Beobachten von Schneeflocken!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Günaydın!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Kar tanelerini gözlemlemek için harika
bir gün olacak gibi!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Excuse-moi, j'ai les joues gelées...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
alors j'ai du mal à sourire.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Mais le
cœur y est, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ho le guance così congelate{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
che stamattina{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} faccio una gran
fatica a sorridere,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}It's afternoon and it's STILL cold!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Be sure to dress warmly, and try
not to get too wet,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}¡Uf! ¡Qué brisa tan gélida!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Menos mal que me he acordado de
cerrar las ventanas,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Che vento gelido!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Meno male che mi sono ricordata di
chiudere le finestre,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Öğleden sonra oldu ve hava HÂLÂ soğuk!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sıkı giyin, mümkün olduğunca
